# Lab safety

Do **not** run mutating AWS CLI or `terraform apply` / `destroy` while authoring.
Author commands in docs/scripts; the human runs the lab.

Opt-in (operator only):

```bash
export ACM_LAB_ALLOW_AWS=1
```

Read-only `aws` (`describe` / `list` / `get` / `sts get-*`) and `terraform fmt` /
`validate` / `plan` are fine. Never commit private keys, production CA PEMs, or
`.tfstate`. Destroy Private CA promptly — monthly charge while it exists.

Details: `.kiro/steering/lab-safety.md`, hook `.kiro/hooks/guard-aws-mutations.py`.
